{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","真相昭示"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时展开推演，推演结束后收集线索曝光犯人，主动释放时揭露敌人弱点施加负面效果。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始前在自身对称位置召唤继承自身100%属性的“投影”，对“投影”及其周围1格范围内的敌人展开最多持续8秒的推演，该过程不计入战斗时间。推演完成后“投影”消失，并认定其中攻击“投影”的敌人作为“罪犯”，对“投影”造成最高伤害的“罪犯”视为“主犯”。\n在挑战首领的模式中，若该范围内只有1名敌人，则跳过推演过程直接认定该敌人为“主犯”。\n被动地，自身会在战斗中每秒收集“罪犯”的3点线索，收集100点线索后会使“罪犯”被彻底曝光，使其能量获取效率降低60%并且降低24% + 3%基础属性。此外，收集“主犯”以及处于控制状态的“罪犯”的线索时，每秒额外收集2点，同时处于这两种状态时额外收集量会叠加。\n主动释放时，推理揭露敌人弱点，使所有敌人在接下来10秒内造成伤害降低15% + 1.5%，受到伤害提高12% + 1%，“罪犯”受到该效果的影响额外提高100%。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":236,"end":241,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"},{"start":339,"end":346,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg9"},{"start":356,"end":361,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg10"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“罪犯”被彻底曝光后降低的基础属性提高至26% + 3%基础属性。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“罪犯”被彻底曝光后降低的基础属性提高至28% + 3%基础属性。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“罪犯”被彻底曝光后降低的基础属性提高至30% + 3%基础属性。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","“罪犯”被彻底曝光后降低的基础属性提高至32% + 3%基础属性。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","矛盾排除"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","投掷烟斗造成范围伤害，并致盲其中的犯人。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，推演选定的范围视为“犯罪现场”，收集位于“犯罪现场”的“罪犯”线索时，每秒还会再额外收集3点。\n主动释放时，在指定位置投掷烟斗干扰敌人，对其周围1格范围内的敌人造成240% + 30% ATK伤害并使目标在接下来8秒内降低30% + 3%攻击力，若该目标为“罪犯”，额外使其致盲8秒。该技能优先对“罪犯”最密集的区域释放。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":90,"end":96,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":118,"end":123,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":86,"end":100,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害量提高至260% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害量提高至280% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害量提高至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","演绎法则"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","为最靠前和最虚弱的友军分别添加护盾。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","驱动机械装置提前布置反制手段，为最靠前和最虚弱的友军添加380% + 40% ATK的护盾持续10秒，护盾存在期间受到来自“罪犯”的伤害降低30% + 3%。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":38,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":73,"end":78,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"keyword:frontest"},{"start":20,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":28,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","护盾量提高至400% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","护盾量提高至420% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","护盾量提高至440% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身急速，有犯人被曝光或击败后额外提高。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","自身提高9点急速，有“罪犯”被曝光或被击败后额外提高6点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","自身提高12点急速，有“罪犯”被曝光或被击败后额外提高8点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","自身提高15点急速，有“罪犯”被曝光或被击败后额外提高10点。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","莱辛巴赫秘辛"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","用投影代替自身战斗，自身退居幕后更快地收集线索。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“推演”结束后，用继承自身100%属性且具有额外200点初始能量的“投影”代替自身进入战斗，自身则退至幕后，进入无敌状态直到“投影”被击败。退居幕后期间，自身收集线索的效率提高150%。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":56,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“投影”的初始能量提高至300点。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","当“罪犯”被曝光后，将受到社会更严厉的排斥：受到来自他人的治疗或护盾降低99%，且受到的生命损耗提高10%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“投影”的初始能量提高至400点。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","推演结束后根据敌人的战斗过程施加不同的控制效果。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","推演结束后，若“罪犯”在推演期间释放过终极技能，使其沉默持续7秒，否则使其缴械持续7秒。若“罪犯”为首领敌人，则使其受到生命损耗提高22.1%持续13秒。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","揭露之眼"]]}